      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why one registry",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why one registry",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-42",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 954,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 272,
      "height": 275.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two registries can\ndrift: a fix to shadow-\ncomparison logic applied\nto one and forgotten\nin the other.\n\nresolve(...,as_of) is\npoint-in-time correct\nby construction \u2014 closes\nthe prompt look-ahead\nleak R19 \u00a78 found.\n\nBacked by MLflow,\nwrapped so no vendor\ntype leaks into BC4/BC5,\nsame rule as the broker\nand LLM Gateway ACLs.\n\nSLO\nresolve() < 10ms p99",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two registries can\ndrift: a fix to shadow-\ncomparison logic applied\nto one and forgotten\nin the other.\n\nresolve(...,as_of) is\npoint-in-time correct\nby construction \u2014 closes\nthe prompt look-ahead\nleak R19 \u00a78 found.\n\nBacked by MLflow,\nwrapped so no vendor\ntype leaks into BC4/BC5,\nsame rule as the broker\nand LLM Gateway ACLs.\n\nSLO\nresolve() < 10ms p99",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
